{'symbol': 'CVX', 'date': '2021-01-27 16:30:00', 'title': 'CHEVRON ANNOUNCES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': 'SAN RAMON, CALIF.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF CHEVRON CORPORATION (NYSE: CVX) DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF ONE DOLLAR AND TWENTY-NINE CENTS ($1.29) PER SHARE, PAYABLE MARCH 10, 2021 TO ALL HOLDERS OF COMMON STOCK AS SHOWN ON THE TRANSFER RECORDS OF THE CORPORATION AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS FEBRUARY 17, 2021.'}